{"id":"donner","lemma":"Donner","pos":"noun","rank":3439,"glosses":["thunder"],"ipa":"/ˈdɔnɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dd/De-Donner.ogg/De-Donner.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Donners","plural":"Donner"},"formAudio":{"Donners":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Donners.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Donner wurde lauter.","en":"The thunder became louder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566578","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"sincere"}]},{"text":"Hast du den Donner grollen gehört?","en":"Did you hear the thunder rumbling?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to grumble, to thunder"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]},{"text":"Die Kinder hatten vor dem Donner Angst.","en":"The thunder scared the children.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"fear"}]},{"text":"Nach dem Blitz kam der Donner.","en":"After the lightning, came the thunder.","words":[{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"a bolt of lightning"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Der Donner erschreckte die Schüler.","en":"The thunder frightened the students.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to frighten","l":"erschrecken"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"pupil"}]}]}